{
  "id": "W005-nested-underage-commit",
  "note": "W005：ext／actor.ext／actor.add（ext 裡）放進帶 age < 18 的資料，提交照收；存檔之後讀不回來（讀檔掃任何深度的 age）。",
  "seed": 7,
  "setup": {
    "scenario": "emptyRoom"
  },
  "cases": [
    [
      {
        "op": "ext",
        "key": "roster",
        "value": {
          "npcs": [
            {
              "name": "某人",
              "age": 16
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "op": "actor.ext",
        "id": "pc",
        "key": "family",
        "value": {
          "sister": {
            "age": 12
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  ],
  "expect": "提交時就擋下（ChangeError，狀態不變），和讀檔的底線一致。實際：提交成功，game.load(game.save()) 回「存檔裡有低於 18 的年齡」。"
}
